:2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T15:07:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:07:52Z","body":"I made a GDScript version of the minimal project.\r\n[Godot-Inherited-Scene-Extended-Script-Bug-Reproduction-main-gd.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33064578/Godot-Inherited-Scene-Extended-Script-Bug-Reproduction-main-gd.zip)\r\nThe issue does not appear there, so it's C# specific. Can the fix also be somewhere in C# implementation, or is it not possible? (just wondering)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5997233512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5998618575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118822#issuecomment-5998618575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118822","id":5998618575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZYunzw","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T16:26:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T16:26:28Z","body":"> I made a GDScript version of the minimal project. [Godot-Inherited-Scene-Extended-Script-Bug-Reproduction-main-gd.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33064578/Godot-Inherited-Scene-Extended-Script-Bug-Reproduction-main-gd.zip) The issue does not appear there, so it's C# specific. Can the fix also be somewhere in C# implementation, or is it not possible? (just wondering)\r\n\r\nGDScript doesn't need proxy classes, as it uses the pointer directly. That's why it doesn't happen there.\r\n\r\nC# needs proxy classes for Godot Objects to be able to benefit from the OOP features of the language. When creating a proxy for an `Node` without a script, we attach a script binding with `Node` as the proxy class. But when attaching a script, the proxy class must now be the one declared by the user in their script file, thus replacing the previous one.\r\n\r\nIt's unlikely we can solve this any other way in C# unless we were to require wrappers (e.g., `NodeRef<Node>`) as the type for exported nodes.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, the spirit of this PR aligns well with the direction this proposal advocates godotengine/godot-proposals#15451.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5998618575/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021470979","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118822#issuecomment-6021470979","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118822","id":6021470979,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZuhbAw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T17:11:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:11:20Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021470979/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]